# launchworthy reads no environment of its own. This file documents the one
# optional variable the skill looks for when it audits a project.
#
# Names only, never values. See references/fixes/git-history-secrets.md.

# Optional. Enables the wide screening step described in SKILL.md, Step 2, and
# only on projects large enough for it to matter. The skill asks before sending
# anything, and declining costs coverage on big repositories and nothing else.
# Key: https://console.typesafe.ai/settings/keys
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
